Subject: [PATCH 5/7] relax std: the Command, PathBuf, OsString and Rc methods
 tokio, camino and serde_with call

Missing from the std, each an E0599 in a dependency of octos or octoscode:
- CommandExt::uid / gid (tokio::process). As real std: such a Command forks
  instead of posix_spawn; the child sets the group, drops the supplementary
  groups (EPERM is not an error), then sets the user.
- PathBuf::add_extension, leak, try_reserve, reserve_exact, try_reserve_exact,
  shrink_to_fit, shrink_to; Path::file_prefix, with_added_extension (camino).
- OsString::leak and the same capacity methods; OsStr::make_ascii_lowercase,
  make_ascii_uppercase, is_ascii.
- Rc::pin (serde_with).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
